hecked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BaseForRandom}(A)\\iff\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[A\\le_T X\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BaseForRandom}(A)\\iff\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\,[A\\le_T X\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^A(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>定义已逐项对照 Hirschfeldt–Nies–Stephan 作者论文摘要首段：存在 X≥T A 且 X 相对 A 随机。所供2007草稿§15.1.13只有占位文字，故明确采用书外已核对定义；等价定理另见43-thm-kt-base-for-random。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"tar